# 분리 창에서 비롯된 닫기 확인은 본 창에 열리고 본 창이 앞으로 온다(요청 횟수 main-activations).
waittabs 1 @30000
send echo C-ONE\r
waitline C-ONE @20000
key ctrl-shift-t
waittabs 2 @20000
send echo C-TWO\r
act movetowindow 2
waitstate detached=2 @10000
state before
act detachedclose 2
waitoverlay close-terminal @5000
waitstate main-activations=1 @5000
state confirm-open
shot confirm-main
key escape
waitoverlay none @5000
waitstate detached=2 @3000
state confirm-cancelled
# 분리 창의 Ctrl+Shift+W도 같은 길을 탄다(창 손잡이가 본 창이어야 한다)
keywin 2 ctrl-shift-w
waitoverlay close-terminal @5000
waitstate main-activations=2 @5000
key enter
waittabs 1 @10000
waitstate detached=- @10000
state confirmed
act quick quitstop
wait 3000
